// DOC - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// OLE2 compound file: the eight-byte signature, then a
// sector-allocated directory that this format calls a filesystem.
//
// The same eight bytes are the start of a .doc, an .xls and an
// .msi, and the format distinguishes them by what is inside the
// directory rather than by anything in the header.
//
// There is no greeting in this file, and the reason is worth one
// sentence: a compound file has no name, no comment and no free
// space at all. Every byte belongs to the allocation table or to a
// stream, and a byte that belongs to neither makes the file corrupt.
//
// So this one is a correct header with nothing to say, which is the
// honest answer for three entries rather than a manufactured one.
//
// Hello World!
//
// doc: 512 bytes, dumped sixteen at a time.
//
// The bytes below are not hand-written. They are built from the
// format's own field widths by scripts/build_object_formats.py, and
// scripts/verify_encodings.py reads the fields back by name -- the
// magic number, the lengths, the offsets. A hex dump written from
// memory is wrong in one byte and looks exactly like a correct one.
//

// D0 CF 11 E0 A1 B1 1A E1 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0000
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 3E 00 03 00 FE FF 09 00 |........>.......|   <- 0010
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0020
// 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0030
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0040
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0050
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0060
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0070
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0080
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0090
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00A0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00B0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00C0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00D0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00E0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00F0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0100
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0110
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0120
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0130
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0140
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0150
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0160
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0170
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0180
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0190
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 01A0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 01B0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 01C0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 01D0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 01E0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 01F0
